  "description": "A sex-crazed manwhore. \n\nA sexual deviant worse than a male prostitute. \n\nMin Hwanseong is a man surrounded by scandalous rumors that seem completely unbecoming of his status as a chaebol heir. Through marriage talks arranged by the elders of their families, Seorin ends up going on a matchmaking date with him. \n\n“If we’re going to pass on our genes anyway, wouldn’t it be better for both of us to choose the best possible partner?”\n\nOffended at being treated as nothing more than breeding stock to produce an heir, Seorin tries to call off the engagement. But by then, her family has already sold her off in exchange for a 30-billion-won investment to save their business. \n\nAs Seorin reels from the situation, Hwanseong challenges her to a provocative bet—with breaking off the engagement on the line...\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/pregnant_trap)",
